rrbd_p47_1159","t":"Hi Boy, on your first image (GBPCAD), I marked the first RBD they way I saw it. As you seem to have over 100 posts, it would seem to me you might already have this subject solidified in your mind. And perhaps you might be over-thinking it? I am just assuming this, though\n\nI went ahead and added some extra stuff that I noticed - in the hope that it might help you to see what is going on in that structure. Just my 'two cents'. If it's confusing, I apologize.","a":"naascott","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1159","p":47,"im":["513aee0521120ae067cee1e6b956f3084f1cdeb3"],"fa":"سلام Boy، روی تصویر اولت (GBPCAD) اولین RBD را همان‌طور که خودم می‌دیدم علامت زدم. چون به نظر می‌رسد بیش از 100 پست داری، گمان می‌کنم این موضوع را ذهنت کاملاً تثبیت کرده باشد. و شاید بیش از حد به آن فکر می‌کنی؟ البته من فقط حدس می‌زنم.\n\nپیش رفتم و چند چیز اضافه که دیدم را هم اضافه کردم — به این امید که کمکت کند ببینی در آن ساختار چه می‌گذرد. فقط نظر کوچک من. اگر گیج‌کننده است، عذر می‌خواهم.","ib":{"513aee0521120ae067cee1e6b956f3084f1cdeb3":2},"m":1159},{"id":"dbrrbd_p47_1160","t":"Ok this is my HW.","a":"lv5758","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1160","p":47,"im":["c743ab0974b6ebca6e1bb802ec2080febcc423ac","e4da78c507d83a8f561b2f973cbfb1f62a3b3252","1c4cb043ffb8a38a9437ddb266bda95df197bbdc","d3d610b984ddc1b1fdadc7c7c8c0768cf7eaa084","8b5fddf411b8d3c4a908c0da46671e9a758d2c53","40ded7e79ad64ab57547fbc0f298fefbae9cf9d0","a44cc7ae8f98362f4633638b013c061b0195ea0e"],"fa":"خب این تکلیف من است.","ib":{"c743ab0974b6ebca6e1bb802ec2080febcc423ac":1,"e4da78c507d83a8f561b2f973cbfb1f62a3b3252":1,"1c4cb043ffb8a38a9437ddb266bda95df197bbdc":1,"d3d610b984ddc1b1fdadc7c7c8c0768cf7eaa084":1,"8b5fddf411b8d3c4a908c0da46671e9a758d2c53":1,"40ded7e79ad64ab57547fbc0f298fefbae9cf9d0":1,"a44cc7ae8f98362f4633638b013c061b0195ea0e":1},"m":1160},{"id":"dbrrbd_p47_1161","t":"Hey lv5758,\n\nWow! Lots of levels. I am sure you will be counting these in your sleep tonight:)\n\nOn your first monthly chart of the EU, I would have marked the first leg up as a RBR. Larger time frames equals larger levels (at least to me)","a":"naascott","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1161","p":47,"im":["b848f99bcfadf10199043a5bae22c51e2431ee90"],"fa":"سلام lv5758،\n\nواو! کلی سطح. مطمئنم امشب در خواب هم داری این‌ها را می‌شمری :)\n\nروی اولین چارت ماهانه‌ات از EU، من اولین موج صعودی را RBR علامت می‌زدم. تایم‌فریم بزرگ‌تر یعنی سطوح بزرگ‌تر (حداقل به نظر من)","ib":{"b848f99bcfadf10199043a5bae22c51e2431ee90":3},"m":1161},{"id":"dbrrbd_p47_1162","t":"Hey naascoott, yeah after one pair im off to sleep, LoL. Anyways, thank you for bringing that zone to my attention.\n\nI didnt see it that way first, especially the swap areas. I will surely look for more swap levels. in the future. Thanks","a":"lv5758","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1162","p":47,"im":[],"fa":"سلام naascoott، آره بعد از یک جفت‌ارز می‌روم بخوابم، LoL. به‌هرحال، ممنون که آن ناحیه را به توجه‌ام آوردی.\n\nاول این‌طور نمی‌دیدمش، مخصوصاً ناحیه‌های سواپ. در آینده حتماً دنبال سطوح سواپ بیشتری می‌گردم. ممنون","m":1162},{"id":"dbrrbd_p47_1163","t":"Here's some more.","a":"lv5758","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1163","p":47,"im":["da10b460fdcffe5cb7f933f71e04d9894877fac7","87ba32bab0cdb7748f428284652b7731210add96","97c01c0d2b70fb2a6ccda764aad8bb4ff4b1c5be","f6fe71a6f0f693efbc568151dbf6a2a26c8db28c","a386c860d1212f11ce1b1129c538f120a7890bc6","5d2992bdb90e283cc15cbd95ac74b62f9a3207b6","b552290e8adea85da2ca3557243636a57d5c09d1","823be8fa3f2ba12965aafaa18f37f1f190c49d49","261fcea5ff902e381defbc527372e5d7ab4e2e13","27cc40b0240b2178e556daeda4cf522c9a9216f8"],"fa":"چند تای دیگر هم اینجاست.","ib":{"da10b460fdcffe5cb7f933f71e04d9894877fac7":1,"87ba32bab0cdb7748f428284652b7731210add96":1,"97c01c0d2b70fb2a6ccda764aad8bb4ff4b1c5be":1,"f6fe71a6f0f693efbc568151dbf6a2a26c8db28c":1,"a386c860d1212f11ce1b1129c538f120a7890bc6":1,"5d2992bdb90e283cc15cbd95ac74b62f9a3207b6":1,"b552290e8adea85da2ca3557243636a57d5c09d1":1,"823be8fa3f2ba12965aafaa18f37f1f190c49d49":1,"261fcea5ff902e381defbc527372e5d7